{"version":2,"exportedAt":1772587040003,"story":{"title":"Digger the Dragon","userPrompt":"A brave little dragon","authorStyleId":"sandra-boynton","readingLevel":"emerging","illustrationStyleId":"soft_watercolor","pages":[{"pageNumber":1,"text":"Digger was small.\nDigger was green.\nA brave little dragon, the best ever seen!","illustrationPrompt":"A tiny, bright green dragon named Digger stands proudly with a wide, happy grin. He has small wings and big, friendly eyes. Background: A simple, sunny meadow with a blue sky. Colors: Bright and cheerful, with greens, blues, and yellows. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772586966613,"durationMs":6854,"retries":0,"promptLength":674,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small emerald green scales with a lime green belly and bright orange accents on the wings and tail dragon, big-expressive golden yellow eyes with brave, confident expression, with small leather satchel slung across his chest, small, rounded horns, tiny, almost translucent wings, a cheerful, slightly buck-toothed grin, a single bright orange scale on his forehead shaped like a heart, slim build. Digger, a small green dragon, standing proudly in a sunny meadow. in Sunny Meadow. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":2,"text":"He saw a big bear.\nBear looked so sad!\n\"Why do you frown?\" Digger then said.","illustrationPrompt":"Digger, the little green dragon, looks up at a very large, sad-looking brown bear. The bear is sitting with his head in his paws. Background: A forest with tall trees and dappled sunlight. Colors: Earthy tones with pops of bright green from Digger. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772586964939,"durationMs":51