, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":5,"text":"He brought back the ball!\nThe bear gave a cheer!\n\"You're a great friend!\" said the happy big bear.","illustrationPrompt":"Digger presents the blue fuzzy ball to the bear, who is now smiling widely. The bear is much larger than Digger. Background: The forest scene again, now brighter and more cheerful. Colors: Warm and inviting, with bright blues and greens. Style: Whimsical children's book illustration, cute, friendly, colorful.","imageMeta":{"provider":"flux2","generatedAt":1772586973336,"durationMs":7043,"retries":0,"promptLength":1041,"success":true,"prompt":"soft watercolor illustration, gentle brush strokes, pastel colors, dreamy atmosphere, delicate washes, artistic watercolor painting A small emerald green scales with a lime green belly and bright orange accents on the wings and tail dragon, big-expressive golden yellow eyes with proud, helpful expression, with small leather satchel slung across his chest, small, rounded horns, tiny, almost translucent wings, a cheerful, slightly buck-toothed grin, a single bright orange scale on his forehead shaped like a heart, slim build. A large fluffy brown fur with a lighter tan muzzle and chest bear, medium deep brown eyes with happy, grateful expression, wearing Blue and white striped overalls, with a small patch on the right knee of his overalls, a slightly oversized nose, a small tear in his left ear, a perpetually worried expression when not smiling, a plump, rounded belly, chubby build. Digger returning the blue fuzzy ball to Bear, who is cheering happily. in Sunny Meadow. Child-safe, friendly, no text, no words, no speech bubbles."}},{"pageNumber":6,"text":"Now they play all day long.\nA grand, happy pair.\nThe brave little dragon and his friend, big bear!","illustrationPrompt":"Digger and the bear are playing together in the meadow. Digger is playfully batting the blue fuzzy ball with his tail, and the bear is laughing. Background: 